{
  "voice": "af_bella:0.7+am_puck:0.3",
  "speed": 0.98,
  "model": "Kokoro-82M v1.0 ONNX (onnx-community, Apache-2.0)",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "text": "This window is a metal net.",
      "file": "l01.wav",
      "duration": 1.462,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 4.11
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "text": "Light gets through. So why don't the microwaves?",
      "file": "l02.wav",
      "duration": 2.666,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "text": "Microwaves are waves about twelve centimeters long.",
      "file": "l03.wav",
      "duration": 2.943,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 2.38
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "text": "The holes are only about a millimeter wide, over a hundred times smaller.",
      "file": "l04.wav",
      "duration": 4.14,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 3.14
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "text": "To waves that long, the net is like solid metal, so they bounce back inside.",
      "file": "l05.wav",
      "duration": 4.462,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 3.36
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "text": "Light waves are about two thousand times smaller than the holes, so they slip through.",
      "file": "l06.wav",
      "duration": 4.59,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 3.27
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "text": "So if the door is bent, or won't close firmly, stop using it.",
      "file": "l07.wav",
      "duration": 3.509,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 3.7
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "text": "Download Recall to turn your study material into lessons.",
      "file": "l08.wav",
      "duration": 3.283,
      "sr": 24000,
      "words_per_s": 2.74
    }
  ]
}